    "label": "74",
    "prompt": "Solve the following.\n$$\\frac{3^{x+1}}{9^x}=\\frac{81^{2-x}}{27}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac43$.\n\nWrite both quotients as powers of 3 and equate their indices.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3^{x+1}}{3^{2x}}&=\\frac{3^{4(2-x)}}{3^3}\\\\3^{x+1-2x}&=3^{8-4x-3}\\\\3^{1-x}&=3^{5-4x}\\\\1-x&=5-4x\\\\3x&=4\\\\x&=\\frac43\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
